flowchart TD
 R[Required obligation x slice cells] --> M[Cell matrix]
 W[Collected witnesses] --> B{Compatible bindings?}
 B -->|no| F[BLOCKED]
 B -->|yes| M
 M --> C{Critical failure?}
 C -->|yes| F
 C -->|no| U{Missing or noncritical failure?}
 U -->|yes| H[HOLD]
 U -->|no| P[READY_FOR_REVIEW]
 P --> A[Human authority bound to evidence digest]
